WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.583
The copper roller sits beside the cam pocket. The dot marks one side of the roller.

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:02.667
The roller touches the lever nose. The technician feels the contact through the dial.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.750
The cam turns back and the roller moves clear of the nose.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.250
A different side of the roller now faces the nose. The wheel hasn’t moved.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.000
The cam turns farther before the roller touches the nose again.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.583
The fence drops into the wheel gate, lowering the nose.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:12.542
The same side of the roller now meets the nose at its new height.

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:13.333
Turning the roller changes the reading again, even with the fence down in the gate.
